columns: |dV|rel, |dQ|rel = relative difference of -<pK/V>, -<pW/Q> from <eta>-mu; idmax = largest relative residual of all pointwise identities;
         ord = branch orderings at equal U / equal p (167+167 exact level matches); 3.1 = Delta<0 on 300x299 ordered pairs; cvx = F^(q2-q1)<0 on the same pairs;
         mono = gradient monotonicity on pairs; sgn = V,Q,K,W>0 and (eta-eta0)p<0, (eta-eta1)p<0 at every sample ("fl?" = judged from floats, see VERIFY.md).
